&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 22px; text-align: left"&gt;三菱ＵＦＪ信託銀行株式会社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 40px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 182.4px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 10px; text-align: left"&gt;取次所&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 465.6px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
